{#
  Helm values for Loki (grafana-community/loki chart). Deploys Loki in
  Monolithic mode — a single StatefulSet replica backed by one Longhorn RWO
  PVC — using local filesystem storage instead of S3/MinIO. This chart moved
  from grafana/helm-charts to grafana-community/helm-charts in March 2026;
  the copy left behind in the old repo is frozen at 6.55.0 and gets no
  further security fixes.

  Filesystem storage means there is no object-storage dependency (no bundled
  MinIO, no external S3), at the cost of horizontal scalability — Monolithic
  mode is single-replica by design. A single node's disk holds
  {{ loki_retention_period }} of this cluster's logs; nothing here needs
  Loki to scale horizontally.

  read/write/backend replicas must be zeroed explicitly: setting
  deploymentMode: Monolithic does not itself disable the SimpleScalable
  targets, and the chart refuses to install if both sets of replicas are
  non-zero at once (their defaults are all 3).

  chunksCache and resultsCache (memcached StatefulSets the chart deploys
  alongside Loki) are disabled. Left at chart defaults, they reserved ~9.6Gi
  and ~1.2Gi of memory respectively — more than the log store's own PVC —
  sized for a multi-replica deployment querying the same chunks repeatedly,
  not a single-binary homelab instance.

  auth_enabled is false because this is a single-tenant deployment: Alloy
  and Grafana would otherwise need to send an X-Scope-OrgID header on every
  request for no benefit.

  Retention is enforced by the compactor rather than the legacy
  table_manager, which is how the TSDB index (the schema's 'store') expects
  retention to be configured. delete_request_store must still be set even
  though nothing here issues delete requests directly — the compactor
  refuses to run retention sweeps without a configured store for them.

  Variables:
    loki_retention_period: How long the compactor keeps logs before deleting
                            them, in Loki duration syntax (e.g. 168h).
    loki_pvc_size:          Size of the Longhorn RWO PVC backing the
                            singleBinary StatefulSet's filesystem storage.
#}
deploymentMode: Monolithic

loki:
  auth_enabled: false
  commonConfig:
    replication_factor: 1
  storage:
    type: filesystem
  schemaConfig:
    configs:
      - from: '2024-01-01'
        store: tsdb
        object_store: filesystem
        schema: v13
        index:
          prefix: index_
          period: 24h
  compactor:
    retention_enabled: true
    delete_request_store: filesystem
  limits_config:
    retention_period: {{ loki_retention_period }}

singleBinary:
  replicas: 1
  persistence:
    enabled: true
    storageClass: longhorn
    size: {{ loki_pvc_size }}

read:
  replicas: 0

write:
  replicas: 0

backend:
  replicas: 0

chunksCache:
  enabled: false

resultsCache:
  enabled: false
